    "detailed_description": "Benjiro, a student from high-tech and traditional Japan, moves to the U.S. with hopes of embracing a new life filled with freedom and excitement. The moment he steps into his university dorm, he\u2019s ready to shed the cultural restraints of his homeland and dive into the unknown.<br>However, the university life isn\u2019t as welcoming as he\u2019d hoped. His first day at the university is mostly uneventful, until Martha, the university president, gives him a brief tour of the campus, revealing the rules and lifestyle he must navigate. What begins as a typical introduction quickly turns into an unforgettable adventure that opens up a world of new relationships.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508760/extras/664c70daf22e1ce286c9e5f9edc8f6f8.poster.avif?t=1749985779\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508760/extras/664c70daf22e1ce286c9e5f9edc8f6f8.webm?t=1749985779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508760/extras/664c70daf22e1ce286c9e5f9edc8f6f8.mp4?t=1749985779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As Benjiro settles into his new life, he must balance his studies, a part-time job, and the pursuit of freedom that lies in exploring his desires. With each new encounter, he faces decisions that will shape his time at university and his future.<br><br>Will Benjiro embrace the full spectrum of student life, or will he struggle with his repressed desires? <strong>Sex Dorm</strong>\ud83d\udd1e offers a bold and provocative journey where your choices lead to multiple paths and experiences. Dive in and experience what university life could be when freedom knows no bounds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508760/extras/39ccff64ba04cbeeb9cf493525a023ef.poster.avif?t=1749985779\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508760/extras/39ccff64ba04cbeeb9cf493525a023ef.webm?t=1749985779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508760/extras/39ccff64ba04cbeeb9cf493525a023ef.mp4?t=1749985779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intuitive gameplay that rewards your creativity \u2013 Make bold choices and watch the consequences unfold in this immersive visual novel. Every decision shapes Benjiro\u2019s journey, from his relationships to his deepest desires.<br><br></li><li>Fully animated 3D characters \u2013 Get up close and personal with fully realized, real-time 3D characters, bringing each interaction to life with smooth animations that enhance your experience.<br><br></li><li>Endless spicy scenarios to spice up your college life \u2013 Explore a variety of seductive and thrilling encounters, each with its own twists and turns. From spontaneous hookups to forbidden encounters, you\u2019ll never know what\u2019s around the corner.<br><br></li><li>Explore a dynamic, open-world campus \u2013 Roam freely through your university and dorm, uncovering hidden spots, secret locations, and spontaneous events that lead to unforgettable experiences.<br><br></li><li>Convenient one-handed play option for full immersion \u2013 Experience the game in your own style with a one-handed play mode, designed for maximum comfort and a totally hands-on experience ( \u0361~ \u035c\u0296 \u0361\u00b0).</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Benjiro, a student from high-tech and traditional Japan, moves to the U.S. with hopes of embracing a new life filled with freedom and excitement. The moment he steps into his university dorm, he\u2019s ready to shed the cultural restraints of his homeland and dive into the unknown.<br>However, the university life isn\u2019t as welcoming as he\u2019d hoped. His first day at the university is mostly uneventful, until Martha, the university president, gives him a brief tour of the campus, revealing the rules and lifestyle he must navigate. What begins as a typical introduction quickly turns into an unforgettable adventure that opens up a world of new relationships.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508760/extras/664c70daf22e1ce286c9e5f9edc8f6f8.poster.avif?t=1749985779\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508760/extras/664c70daf22e1ce286c9e5f9edc8f6f8.webm?t=1749985779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508760/extras/664c70daf22e1ce286c9e5f9edc8f6f8.mp4?t=1749985779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As Benjiro settles into his new life, he must balance his studies, a part-time job, and the pursuit of freedom that lies in exploring his desires. With each new encounter, he faces decisions that will shape his time at university and his future.<br><br>Will Benjiro embrace the full spectrum of student life, or will he struggle with his repressed desires? <strong>Sex Dorm</strong>\ud83d\udd1e offers a bold and provocative journey where your choices lead to multiple paths and experiences. Dive in and experience what university life could be when freedom knows no bounds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=